    <tags>blockwork macro automation keyboard mouse hotkey</tags>
    <summary>Visually build and run keyboard/mouse macros with a Scratch-style block editor.</summary>
    <description>Blockwork is a desktop app for visually building and running keyboard and mouse macros. It has a Scratch-style block editor for instruction sequences, variables, and hotkey-triggered playback.</description>
